  "title": "Chocolate Meringue Pie",
  "description": "Make this decadent chocolate meringue pie recipe with homemade chocolate pudding poured into a crust, covered with fluffy meringue, and baked until golden brown.",
  "authors": [
    "Lorrie Sterling"
  ],
